{"zh_word": "攀爬", "zaz aen daiz doenq laeng di.",
        "zh": "把桌子往后移点。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngamqngamq dog deng de, de couh laemx lo.",
        "zh": "只是轻轻地碰了他一下，他就倒下去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byaij doh daengx guek.",
        "zh": "走遍全国各地。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen cenj neix dwg doh gou.",
        "zh": "这只杯子是我的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemxrongz doiq lo.",
        "zh": "洪水下降了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij byaek neix ndaem ndaej doiqhaw lo.",
        "zh": "这些菜种得一圩了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou doj mwngz gamj benz hwnj dingj faex bae.",
        "zh": "我赌你敢爬到树顶上去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu saux dongj makbug.",
        "zh": "拿竹竿捅柚子。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raen vunz aeu dongx.",
        "zh": "见人要打招呼。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guh gijmaz hong gaej guh daengz donh couh vut.",
        "zh": "做什么工作，不要半途而废。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenz gwn sam donq haeux.",
        "zh": "一天吃三餐饭。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De bouxboux doq mbouj saenq.",
        "zh": "他人人都不信。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej dosaeh lai!",
        "zh": "你别多事。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz roeg douh youq gwnz faex.",
        "zh": "鸟儿在树上栖息。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaej hawj nengznyaen douh vanj.",
        "zh": "不要让苍蝇爬碗。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou byaij dox- hwnj, mwngz byaij dox- roengz.",
        "zh": "我往上走，你往下走。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doxcanj bae dang bing.",
        "zh": "踊跃去参军。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song gyaeuj cungj doxdaengh.",
        "zh": "两头平衡。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux de gig doxdaengh.",
        "zh": "他俩很相称。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawz song diuz cag doxdam hwnj daeuj.",
        "zh": "把两条绳子连接起来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doxdam byaij okbae.",
        "zh": "一个跟着一个地走出去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux raeuz doxdiem daem haeux.",
        "zh": "我们两个轮流舂米。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj caeuq de doxhoenx.",
        "zh": "我不和他打架。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux de doxngamj raixcaix.",
        "zh": "他们两人意气相投。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux de doxraen lo.",
        "zh": "他们俩人见面了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byaij doxroengz.",
        "zh": "往下走。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naj de du lai.",
        "zh": "他脸上尽是疙瘩。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duenz duenz yawj ndaw neix miz geijlai aen.",
        "zh": "猜猜看这里面有多少个？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bonj saw neix duh gou.",
        "zh": "这本书是我的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sou dwg dujva guekcoj.",
        "zh": "你们是祖国的花朵。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dumdeng daeuj.",
        "zh": "他突然来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemxdah dumh lo.",
        "zh": "河水涨了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx dumx gvaq dingj couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "水没过面就行了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu saux dungj makbug.",
        "zh": "拿竹竿捅柚子。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn byaeksoemj daiq lai, dungxgaet raixcaix.",
        "zh": "吃酸菜太多，肚子饿得很厉害。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dungxsaej ak.",
        "zh": "他很有学问。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dw hwnj de bae.",
        "zh": "赶上他。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gienh saeh neix gaej dwen lo.",
        "zh": "这件事别提了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix caen dwgcaengz.",
        "zh": "这个人真可憎。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix caen dwghaemz lai lo!",
        "zh": "这个人真可恨。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu nywj dwk vaiz.",
        "zh": "拿青草喂牛。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwkdaengz ngoenzneix de cij ma.",
        "zh": "直到今天他才回来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dang di faenh cai e ndeu, cungj vifung dangqmaz.",
        "zh": "当一份小差事，却威风不得了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Coenz vah neix dwg maz eiqsei?",
        "zh": "这句话是什么意思？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De mbouj eiqseiq.",
        "zh": "他不好意思。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yawj gaiq neix miz maz eiqseiq?",
        "zh": "看这些东西有什么意思？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Euj diuz oij neix guh baenz song donh.",
        "zh": "把这条甘蔗折成两段",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mingzmingz mbouj deng, de lij euqmanz.",
        "zh": "明明不对，他还强词夺理。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej euqmengx lo!",
        "zh": "你别强辩了！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Faen baenz geij faenh?",
        "zh": "分成几份？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De baenz ngoenz bae faengz sau.",
        "zh": "他整天去恋情人。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz miz faenh lwi?",
        "zh": "你有份吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej daeuj ra gou faeqheiq!",
        "zh": "你别来找我的麻烦！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz fanjdui gij vunz fag gwn gik guh hong haenx.",
        "zh": "我们反对那些只会吃懒做工的人。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Swiq faj naj mwngz.",
        "zh": "洗你那张脸。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Da fangz lo.",
        "zh": "眼瞎了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Couhcinj de ndei fanhdien, caemh mbouj beij bohmeh ndei.",
        "zh": "就算她非常好，也不比父母好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawz gij doxgaiq neix fat hawj caezgya.",
        "zh": "把这些东西分发给大家。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx feuz lai.",
        "zh": "水很浅。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naj foeg lo.",
        "zh": "脸肿了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Faj naj de foegfouz.",
        "zh": "他的脸浮肿。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Foengq maknganx neix miz haj gaen naek.",
        "zh": "这束龙眼果有五斤重。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae fueng lawz?",
        "zh": "你去哪一方？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Heiq fwi lo.",
        "zh": "蒸气冒上来了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix fwnraemx cuk.",
        "zh": "今年雨水充足。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De fwt riu lo.",
        "zh": "他突然笑了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen fuengz neix gaeb lai.",
        "zh": "这间房子很窄。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gaenbonj guh mbouj deng saek di.",
        "zh": "他做的根本不对。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gaenq bae lu.",
        "zh": "他已经去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij caeg neix gaenzgaeq youq henz mbanj raeuz.",
        "zh": "这些土匪潜伏在咱们的村边。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij raemxndaengq neix gaet lai.",
        "zh": "这碱水腐蚀性大。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nou gaet buh.",
        "zh": "老鼠咬衣服。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej gag bae.",
        "zh": "你别单独去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gag songvunz ndwi ha?",
        "zh": "仅止两个人吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeq lwg de daej gahraixcaixciz.",
        "zh": "他的小孩哭得很厉害。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yaek vuenh daengbauq sien gven gaihgvanh.",
        "zh": "要换灯泡，先关开关。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaiq gizgiz biq myaiz!",
        "zh": "不要随地吐痰！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawz doenghyiengh gak ndei dwk.",
        "zh": "把东西搁好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dingq le, ndawsim gamjdoengh.",
        "zh": "他听了，心里感动。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz ma neix gamz ndaek ndok ndeu.",
        "zh": "这条狗衔了一大块骨头。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaxgonq vunzgoeng gan guh hong hawj dicuj, mbouj ndaej gwn donq imq.",
        "zh": "过去长工白给地主干活，不得吃一餐饱。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bak gaen rap cungj ndaej, gangjnaeuz haj cib gaen.",
        "zh": "一百斤都挑得，何况五十斤。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ganjnaeuz de bae hagdangz la.",
        "zh": "我以为他上学去了.",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz geij boux gap guh.",
        "zh": "咱们几个人合伙做。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou caeuq mwngz gap baengzyoux.",
        "zh": "我和你交朋友。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz geij box gapdoq guh.",
        "zh": "咱们几个人合伙做。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux gapsouj cawx aen ci ndeu.",
        "zh": "两人搭伙买一架车。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Biek go gauhneix nanz.",
