        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen lae neix miz caet mbaek.",
        "zh": "这梯子有七级。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix miz haj mbaek naz.",
        "zh": "这里有五块田。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawz diuz oij neix raemj baenj haj mbaenq.",
        "zh": "把这根甘蔗砍成五节。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhneix miz denqyingj, mbouj hawj de bae yawj, de mbaetmbeuj lo.",
        "zh": "今晚有电影，不让她去看，她生气了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diuz daez neix mbaeu raixcai.",
        "zh": "这道题很浅。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bau mbai mbai hong.",
        "zh": "你负责派工。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu aen gei neix ma demh naengh, aen de mban liux lo.",
        "zh": "拿这个泥箕来垫坐，它都扁平啦。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Reih haeuxyangz neix doek ndaej mbang lai.",
        "zh": "这块玉米地种子播得太稀了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fag cax nex mbanq lo!",
        "zh": "这把刀的刀口略缺了！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbek aen makbug guh song mbiengj bae.",
        "zh": "把这个柚子掰成两半。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen deb neix mbenmbetmbet.",
        "zh": "这个碟子又扁又平",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh mbeuj lo.",
        "zh": "坐歪了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx dah mboek lo.",
        "zh": "河水下降了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboengq neix raeuz ndaemnaz.",
        "zh": "这段时间我们插秧。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbon gij doxgaiq ndaw daeh ok daeuj.",
        "zh": "把口袋里的东西掏出来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Da mbot lo.",
        "zh": "眼瞎了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vunz mboujcaengz daeuj.",
        "zh": "人未曾来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz mou neix mboujcij haj cib gaen.",
        "zh": "这头猪不止五十斤。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboujcix doegsaw, mboujcix guhhong, gaej luenh bae guhcaemz.",
        "zh": "要么读书，要么做工，不要乱玩耍。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mboujdaemx mwngz.",
        "zh": "我不及你。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij saek neix mboujdaih hoengz.",
        "zh": "这颜色不太红。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz de bi neix mboujdan ndaej haeux lai, vanzlij miz haujlai bit gaeq dem.",
        "zh": "今年他家不仅打下很多粮食，而且还养有很多鸡鸭。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mboujeiqseiq bae giz de.",
        "zh": "我不好意思去他那里。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbwn yienznaeuz gvengq lo, mboujgvaq roen lij mbaeq.",
        "zh": "天虽然晴了，不过路还湿。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yiengh neix guh mboujlaz?",
        "zh": "这样做不好吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyanghaet mbwn gig gvengq, mboujliuh banringz fwn doek.",
        "zh": "早上天气很晴朗，想不到中午会下雨。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De mboujlwnh veh gijmaz, cungj naengz youh cinj youh vaih vrh ok daeuj.",
        "zh": "他不论画什么东西，都能逼真而又迅速地画出来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byaij vaiq di, mboujmiz gou couh mbouj caj mengz lo!",
        "zh": "快走，不然我就不等你了！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboujseih! Gou senq couh naeuz gvaq lo.",
        "zh": "可不是！我老早就说过了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Faj naj de mbuemq.",
        "zh": "他的脸浮肿。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbokfeiz deng gyan mbup lo.",
        "zh": "吹火筒被压扁了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawx yw ma mbw nou.",
        "zh": "买药毒老鼠。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Donqdonq gwn lwggva, cungj gwn mbwk lo.",
        "zh": "餐餐吃南瓜，吃得厌了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naj de mbwng lo.",
        "zh": "她面带愁容。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Meh buh neix mbouj ndei.",
        "zh": "这种衣服不好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Da mengz lo.",
        "zh": "眼瞎了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix gwn laeuj fiz lo, gangj vah mezsez.",
        "zh": "这个人喝醉了酒，讲话颠倒冗赘。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De deng miq lo.",
        "zh": "他挨批评了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "It bi ndaem sam miuz.",
        "zh": "一年种三糙。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De mizseiz daeuj, mizseiz mbouj daeuj.",
        "zh": "他有时来，有时不来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix moegdoeg lai, cungj mbouj gangj dauhleix.",
        "zh": "这个人太粗鲁了，总不讲道理。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Moeggyaengh mbouj doeng rumz.",
        "zh": "木棍不通风[成语，喻头脑不开窍的人]",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu namh daeuj moek dong nyapnyaj neix ndei bae.",
        "zh": "拿土来把这堆垃圾掩盖好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gang haeux neix mojmwtmwt.",
        "zh": "这缸米满满的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Feiz yaek mon lo, vaiq dem fwnz haeuj cauq bae.",
        "zh": "火将灭了，快添柴进灶。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Geu buh neix moqsaksak.",
        "zh": "这件衣服很新。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz song muek dieg.",
        "zh": "有两片地。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De baezneix muenghluenj dahraix, bae dwk bya cungj mbouj ndaej saek duz.",
        "zh": "他这次真失望，去打鱼一条也没打着。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx muenx gvaq gyaeuj lo.",
        "zh": "水冒过头硬了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Giz gyae mumjmumj yawj mbouj cingcuj.",
        "zh": "远处，朦朦胧胧看不清。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxdauh mwd fap.",
        "zh": "道公念符咒。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aiq ndaem lo, mwngz couh gvaq seiz.",
        "zh": "你要快些种啦，否则就过季节了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Loh myag lai.",
        "zh": "路太滑",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haeux neix nienj ndaej naed raixcaix.",
        "zh": "这些米成粒的，碾得很好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naj baengz naeg lai.",
        "zh": "布面很窄。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix naegnad lai.",
        "zh": "这个人太懒。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bonj saw neix naek lai lo.",
        "zh": "这本书太深奥了.",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux de ganjcingz naekna lai.",
        "zh": "他们两人感情很深厚。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ndaej bae Baekging naengh ndei lo.",
        "zh": "我能去北京就好了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Donq byaek haemhneix naengq raixcaix!",
        "zh": "今晚晚餐的菜很丰盛！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cenzsuijdingj naengz bongh youq laj raemx.",
        "zh": "潜水艇能在水底行驶。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naenx gij naeng duhnamh okbae.",
        "zh": "把花生皮捻出去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen mak neix naeuh lu.",
        "zh": "这个果子腐烂了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz naeuh lai lo.",
        "zh": "你太无能。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix de deng baihgwnz naeuz lo.",
        "zh": "今天他被上级责备了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naih ngeix naih siliengz.",
        "zh": "越想越凄凉。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laj dat miz naj haz ndeu.",
        "zh": "山崖下有一片茅草。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hwet de nanq raixcaix.",
        "zh": "他腰酸痛得很。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daeuj gizneix ndaej haujlai nanz lo.",
        "zh": "他来这里很久了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cih saw neix nanzdauh mwngz mbouj rox ha?",
        "zh": "这个字难道你不认识吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De nanzmboujnanz daeuj baez ndeu.",
        "zh": "他久不久来一次。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaej nap naj gou.",
        "zh": "别捏我的脸。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De nauq youh daeuj?",
        "zh": "他为何又来？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nauz mwngz gag bae.",
        "zh": "不然你自己去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej mbaw geiznding ndeu.",
        "zh": "得一面红旗。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bang gou ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "你可以帮我吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj ndaej ndaekhix guh.",
        "zh": "不能这样做。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu raemx ndaengq daeuj saeg buh.",
        "zh": "要碱水来洗衣服。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij byaek neix ndaengq lai.",
        "zh": "这菜太咸了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ndaenj hwnj ci lo.",
        "zh": "他挤上车了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwnzhaw vunz ndaet raixcaix.",
        "zh": "圩上人多，拥挤得很。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mou meh ndauq lo.",
        "zh": "母猪发情了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix caen ndeigyaez!",
        "zh": "这个人真可爱！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "⋯⋯ ndicih ciemz gyaj, ndicih ndaemnaz.",
        "zh": "要么就拔秧，要么就插秧。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aenvih de miz saehcingz, ndigah mbouj bae.",
        "zh": "因为他有事情，所以不去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ndiu lo.",
        "zh": "他醒了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj ndaej nduen lai hw.",
        "zh": "讲得很完满。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Go faex neix nduk lu.",
        "zh": "这颗树腐朽了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ne! Aen neix hawj mwngz!",
        "zh": "喏！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz mbouj miz ne?",
        "zh": "有没有呢？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaenx lumj meh de nei.",
        "zh": "象他母亲一样勤快。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ih maz neix?",
        "zh": "这个人为什么愁眉苦脸？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De neix mbouj youq ranz.",
        "zh": "他现在不在家。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De miz lwg nem mbouj ndaej bae lu.",
        "zh": "他有孩子牵挂，不能去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haeuxnaengj neix nembyadbyad.",
        "zh": "这些糯米饭粘粘的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij namh neix net leux lu.",
        "zh": "这些泥土变结实了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj ngaih saeh.",
        "zh": "不关事。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj ngaih mwngz saek di.",
        "zh": "我一点不妨碍你。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cehduh neix ok ngaz lo.",
        "zh": "这颗豆子发芽了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej ngeiz de.",
        "zh": "你不要怀疑他。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngoenzneix ngeuxgeuz mbouj gangj vah.",
        "zh": "他今天闹情绪;不讲话。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj ndaej ngoek gyaeuj lwgnyez.",
        "zh": "不能敲小孩的头.",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fag cax neix ngoemx lo.",
        "zh": "这把刀钝了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diuz loh neix ngutraurau.",
        "zh": "这条路弯弯曲曲的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nik aen bingj soiq bae.",
        "zh": "把这块饼压碎。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbwn nit lo.",
        "zh": "天冷了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haeuxnaengj neix niu raixcaix.",
        "zh": "这些糯米饭很粘。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz ngwz nod bae.",
        "zh": "蛇爬走了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz noiz cienz hawj gou.",
        "zh": "请你暂借钱给我。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De nienzgeij lij nomj.",
        "zh": "他年纪还轻。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nu gij heiz gwnz ndang okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "把身上的污垢搓下来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij mba neix nuenx raixcaix.",
        "zh": "这些粉末很细。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nwi! Meh mwngz daeuj lu.",
        "zh": "唔！你的母亲来了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen loekci neix nwk lai.",
        "zh": "这个车轮很不润滑。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu baengz nwnh daeuj guh daejhaiz.",
        "zh": "拿碎布来做鞋底。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaiq reih neix nyaengq lo.",
        "zh": "这块畲地杂草丛生。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De cungj mbouj lau nyaenq.",
        "zh": "他总不害羞。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaek haeuxsei neix nyaih lo.",
        "zh": "这块米花糖松散了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj aeu, de nyaiz hawj gou.",
        "zh": "我不要，他挜给我。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nyamx aen ceiz neix baenz song mbiengj bae.",
        "zh": "把这块糍巴夹成两半。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij ngaiz neix daiq nyan lai.",
        "zh": "这些饭太干了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaij nohvaiz neix nyangq lai.",
        "zh": "这块牛肉很韧。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij ngaiz neix cawj ndaej nyannyoeknyoek.",
        "zh": "这些饭煮得太干。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux mehmbwk neix nyanq lai.",
        "zh": "这个女人很泼辣。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
